				<div class="et_pb_code_inner"><script type="text/javascript">jQuery(function() { _initLayerSlider( '#layerslider_2_q5p5plh2t2lx', {sliderVersion: '6.9.1', type: 'fullsize', responsiveUnder: 0, allowFullscreen: true, maxRatio: 1, hideUnder: 0, hideOver: 100000, pauseOnHover: 'enabled', skin: 'outline', sliderFadeInDuration: 800, tnContainerWidth: '100%', tnWidth: 170, tnHeight: 100, useSrcset: true, skinsPath: 'https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/plugins/LayerSlider/assets/static/layerslider/skins/', performanceMode: true, height: 600}); });</script><div id="layerslider_2_q5p5plh2t2lx" class="ls-wp-container fitvidsignore" style="width:1000px;height:100vh;margin:0 auto;margin-bottom: 0px;"><div class="ls-slide" data-ls="bgposition:auto;duration:9500;transition2d:5;parallaxtype:3d;parallaxdistance:4;parallaxrotate:20;"><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="1900" height="1267" src="https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/stellenbosch_museum00008.jpg" class="ls-bg" alt="" srcset="https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/stellenbosch_museum00008.jpg 1900w, https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/stellenbosch_museum00008-1280x854.jpg 1280w, https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/stellenbosch_museum00008-980x654.jpg 980w, https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/stellenbosch_museum00008-480x320.jpg 480w" sizes="(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 980px) 980px, (min-width: 981px) and (max-width: 1280px) 1280px, (min-width: 1281px) 1900px, 100vw" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1900" height="1267" src="https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/stellenbosch_museum00015.jpg" class="ls-tn" alt="" srcset="https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/stellenbosch_museum00015.jpg 1900w, https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/stellenbosch_museum00015-300x200.jpg 300w, https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/stellenbosch_museum00015-768x512.jpg 768w, https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/stellenbosch_museum00015-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/stellenbosch_museum00015-1080x720.jpg 1080w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1900px) 100vw, 1900px" /><div style="width:773px;height:362px;border-radius:10px;top:123px;left:20px;background-color:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);font-size:11px;line-height:15px;" class="ls-l ls-html-layer" data-ls="offsetxin:-150;durationin:2000;easingin:easeOutExpo;rotateyin:-30;transformoriginin:50% 50% -300px;offsetxout:100;durationout:800;easingout:easeInExpo;rotateyout:30;transformoriginout:50% 50% -300px;parallax:true;parallaxlevel:20;"></div><p style="font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.03em;font-family:Montserrat;font-size:36px;line-height:36px;color:#505050;top:150px;left:67px;" class="ls-l ls-text-layer" data-ls="offsetxin:-150;durationin:2000;easingin:easeOutExpo;rotateyin:-30;transformoriginin:99.1% 411.1% -700px;offsetxout:100;durationout:800;easingout:easeInExpo;rotateyout:30;transformoriginout:99.1% 411.1% -700px;parallax:true;parallaxlevel:35;">THE SCHREUDERHUIS</p><p style="font-weight:400;width:246px;font-family:Poppins;font-size:13px;line-height:21px;color:#505050;top:219px;left:69px;white-space:normal;" class="ls-l ls-text-layer" data-ls="offsetxin:-150;durationin:2000;easingin:easeOutExpo;rotateyin:-30;transformoriginin:164% 35% -500px;offsetxout:100;durationout:800;easingout:easeInExpo;rotateyout:30;transformoriginout:164% 35% -500px;parallax:true;parallaxlevel:25;">The first house the museum has restored is the Schreuderhuis. This home was built in 1709, and it survived the first great fire in Stellenbosch. Schreuderhuis is the oldest restored and documented town house...</p><a style="" class="ls-l" href="https://stelmus.co.za/village-museum/the-schreuderhuis/" target="_self" data-ls="offsetxin:-150;durationin:2000;easingin:easeOutExpo;rotateyin:-30;transformoriginin:199.2% -244.4% -600px;offsetxout:100;durationout:800;easingout:easeInExpo;rotateyout:30;transformoriginout:199.2% -244.4% -600px;hover:true;hoverdurationin:300;hoveropacity:1;hoverbgcolor:#41e1f0;parallax:true;parallaxlevel:30;"><p style="font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;padding-right:30px;padding-left:30px;font-family:Montserrat;font-size:19px;line-height:45px;color:#ffffff;border-radius:10px;top:389px;left:66px;background-color:#2764b3;" class="ls-text-layer">SEE DETAILS</p></a><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="184" height="404" src="https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/pers3-1.png" class="ls-l ls-img-layer" alt="" srcset="https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/pers3-1.png 184w, https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/pers3-1-137x300.png 137w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 184px) 100vw, 184px" style="top:196px;left:666px;width:183px;height:404px;" data-ls="offsetxin:-150;durationin:2000;easingin:easeOutExpo;rotateyin:-30;transformoriginin:22.6% 30.5% -1000px;offsetxout:100;durationout:800;easingout:easeInExpo;rotateyout:30;transformoriginout:22.6% 30.5% -1000px;parallax:true;parallaxlevel:50;"><a style="" class="ls-l" href="http://www.mini.hu/_common/_shared_files/product_presentation/mini-convertible/overview/living_wall/tile_expanded/01_introduction/pop_up_gallery_img_5.jpg" target="_self" data-ls="offsetxin:-150;durationin:2000;easingin:easeOutExpo;rotateyin:-30;transformoriginin:-185.1% 134.1% -1400px;offsetxout:100;durationout:800;easingout:easeInExpo;rotateyout:30;transformoriginout:-185.1% 134.1% -1400px;hover:true;hoveropacity:1;hoverscalex:0.95;hoverscaley:0.95;parallax:true;parallaxlevel:70;"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="350" height="233" src="https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/v7.jpg" class=" ls-imagelightbox ls-img-layer" alt="" srcset="https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/v7.jpg 350w, https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/v7-300x200.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 350px) 100vw, 350px" style="border-radius:50%;top:169px;left:437px;width:221px;height:204px;"></a><a style="" class="ls-l" href="http://www.mini.hu/_common/_shared_files/product_presentation/mini-convertible/overview/living_wall/tile_expanded/01_introduction/pop_up_gallery_img_4.jpg" target="_self" data-ls="offsetxin:-150;durationin:2000;easingin:easeOutExpo;rotateyin:-30;transformoriginin:-149.2% 170.4% -1200px;offsetxout:100;durationout:800;easingout:easeInExpo;rotateyout:30;transformoriginout:-149.2% 170.4% -1200px;hover:true;hoveropacity:1;hoverscalex:0.95;hoverscaley:0.95;parallax:true;parallaxlevel:60;"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="220" height="175" src="https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/v8.jpg" class=" ls-imagelightbox ls-img-layer" alt="" style="border-radius:50%;top:410px;left:311px;width:156px;height:141px;"></a></div><div class="ls-slide" data-ls="bgsize:cover;bgposition:50% 50%;duration:9500;transition2d:5;parallaxtype:3d;parallaxdistance:4;parallaxrotate:20;"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1900" height="1267" src="https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/stellenbosch_museum00030.jpg" class="ls-bg" alt="" srcset="https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/stellenbosch_museum00030.jpg 1900w, https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/stellenbosch_museum00030-1280x854.jpg 1280w, https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/stellenbosch_museum00030-980x654.jpg 980w, https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/stellenbosch_museum00030-480x320.jpg 480w" sizes="auto, (min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 980px) 980px, (min-width: 981px) and (max-width: 1280px) 1280px, (min-width: 1281px) 1900px, 100vw" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="350" height="233" src="https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/v5.jpg" class="ls-tn" alt="" srcset="https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/v5.jpg 350w, https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/v5-300x200.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 350px) 100vw, 350px" /><div style="width:773px;height:362px;border-radius:10px;top:75px;left:20px;background-color:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);color:#000000;" class="ls-l ls-html-layer" data-ls="offsetxin:-150;durationin:2000;easingin:easeOutExpo;rotateyin:-30;transformoriginin:50% 50% -300px;offsetxout:100;durationout:800;rotateyout:30;transformoriginout:50% 50% -300px;parallax:true;parallaxlevel:20;"></div><p style="font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.03em;font-family:Montserrat;font-size:36px;line-height:36px;color:#505050;top:129px;left:66px;" class="ls-l ls-text-layer" data-ls="offsetxin:-150;durationin:2000;easingin:easeOutExpo;rotateyin:-30;transformoriginin:140.9% 416.7% -700px;offsetxout:100;durationout:800;rotateyout:30;transformoriginout:140.9% 416.7% -700px;parallax:true;parallaxlevel:35;">BLETTERMANHUIS</p><p style="font-weight:400;width:310px;font-family:Poppins;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#505050;top:216px;left:69px;white-space:normal;" class="ls-l ls-text-layer" data-ls="offsetxin:-150;durationin:2000;easingin:easeOutExpo;rotateyin:-30;transformoriginin:124.7% 32.5% -500px;offsetxout:100;durationout:800;rotateyout:30;transformoriginout:124.7% 32.5% -500px;parallax:true;parallaxlevel:25;">The second home in the museum complex is Blettermanhuis. This house has been restored and furnished to illustrate a wealthy Stellenbosch home from around the period of 1750 – 1790...</p><a style="" class="ls-l" href="https://stelmus.co.za/village-museum/blettermanhuis/" target="_self" data-ls="offsetxin:-150;durationin:2000;easingin:easeOutExpo;rotateyin:-30;transformoriginin:199.2% -244.4% -600px;offsetxout:100;durationout:800;rotateyout:30;transformoriginout:199.2% -244.4% -600px;hover:true;hoverdurationin:300;hoveropacity:1;hoverbgcolor:#ffce2e;parallax:true;parallaxlevel:30;"><p style="font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;padding-right:30px;padding-left:30px;font-family:Montserrat;font-size:19px;line-height:45px;color:#ffffff;border-radius:10px;top:347px;left:64px;background-color:#2764b3;" class="ls-text-layer">SEE DETAILS</p></a><a style="" class="ls-l" href="http://www.mini.hu/_common/_shared_files/product_presentation/mini_f56/living_wall/title_expanded/motorisation/gallery/720_405/cooper_s/F56_cooper_s_02_front_detail_gallery_720.jpg" target="_self" data-ls="offsetxin:-150;durationin:2000;easingin:easeOutExpo;rotateyin:-30;transformoriginin:-185.1% 134.1% -1400px;offsetxout:100;durationout:800;rotateyout:30;transformoriginout:-185.1% 134.1% -1400px;hover:true;hoveropacity:1;hoverscalex:0.95;hoverscaley:0.95;parallax:true;parallaxlevel:70;"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="350" height="233" src="https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/v5.jpg" class=" ls-imagelightbox ls-img-layer" alt="" srcset="https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/v5.jpg 350w, https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/v5-300x200.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 350px) 100vw, 350px" style="border-radius:50%;top:353px;left:407px;width:212px;height:206px;"></a><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="186" height="410" src="https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/pers7a.png" class="ls-l ls-img-layer" alt="" srcset="https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/pers7a.png 186w, https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/pers7a-136x300.png 136w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 186px) 100vw, 186px" style="top:190px;left:642px;" data-ls="offsetxin:-150;durationin:2000;easingin:easeOutExpo;rotateyin:-30;transformoriginin:19.7% 22% -1000px;offsetxout:100;durationout:800;rotateyout:30;transformoriginout:19.7% 22% -1000px;parallax:true;parallaxlevel:50;"><a style="" class="ls-l" href="http://www.mini.hu/_common/_shared_files/product_presentation/mini_f56/living_wall/title_expanded/motorisation/gallery/720_405/cooper_s/F56_cooper_s_05_rear_gallery_720.jpg" target="_self" data-ls="offsetxin:-150;durationin:2000;easingin:easeOutExpo;rotateyin:-30;transformoriginin:-149.2% 170.4% -1200px;offsetxout:100;durationout:800;rotateyout:30;transformoriginout:-149.2% 170.4% -1200px;hover:true;hoveropacity:1;hoverscalex:0.95;hoverscaley:0.95;parallax:true;parallaxlevel:60;"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="280" height="186" src="https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/v6.jpg" class=" ls-imagelightbox ls-img-layer" alt="" style="border-radius:50%;top:89px;left:488px;width:182px;height:186px;"></a><img style="top:72px;left:894px;" class="ls-l ls-img-layer" data-ls="durationin:100;delayin:2000;durationout:1500;startatout:transitioninend + 200;easingout:easeOutSine;parallax:true;parallaxlevel:70;"></div><div class="ls-slide" data-ls="bgsize:cover;bgposition:50% 50%;duration:9500;transition2d:5;parallaxtype:3d;parallaxdistance:4;parallaxrotate:20;"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1900" height="1267" src="https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/stellenbosch_museum00054.jpg" class="ls-bg" alt="" srcset="https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/stellenbosch_museum00054.jpg 1900w, https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/stellenbosch_museum00054-300x200.jpg 300w, https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/stellenbosch_museum00054-768x512.jpg 768w, https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/stellenbosch_museum00054-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/stellenbosch_museum00054-1080x720.jpg 1080w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1900px) 100vw, 1900px" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1900" height="1267" src="https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/stellenbosch_museum00054.jpg" class="ls-tn" alt="" srcset="https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/stellenbosch_museum00054.jpg 1900w, https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/stellenbosch_museum00054-300x200.jpg 300w, https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/stellenbosch_museum00054-768x512.jpg 768w, https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/stellenbosch_museum00054-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/stellenbosch_museum00054-1080x720.jpg 1080w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1900px) 100vw, 1900px" /><div style="top:111px;left:51px;background-size:inherit;background-position:inherit;font-size:152px;width:773px;height:362px;line-height:202px;color:#ffffff;background-color:rgba(252, 252, 252, 0.76);" class="ls-l ls-html-layer" data-ls="position:relative;"></div><p style="font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.03em;font-family:Montserrat;font-size:36px;line-height:36px;color:#505050;top:129px;left:66px;" class="ls-l ls-text-layer" data-ls="offsetxin:-150;durationin:2000;easingin:easeOutExpo;rotateyin:-30;transformoriginin:78.2% 416.7% -700px;offsetxout:100;durationout:800;easingout:easeInExpo;rotateyout:30;transformoriginout:78.2% 416.7% -700px;parallax:true;parallaxlevel:35;">GROSVENOR HOUSE</p><p style="font-weight:400;width:310px;font-family:Poppins;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#505050;top:212px;left:69px;white-space:normal;" class="ls-l ls-text-layer" data-ls="offsetxin:-150;durationin:2000;easingin:easeOutExpo;rotateyin:-30;transformoriginin:124.7% 32.5% -500px;offsetxout:100;durationout:800;easingout:easeInExpo;rotateyout:30;transformoriginout:124.7% 32.5% -500px;parallax:true;parallaxlevel:25;">Originally built by Christian Ludolph Neethling in 1782, Grosvenor House was added to by successive owners until it reached its present appearance in 1803. Grosvenor House, along with Koopmans de Wet House...</p><a style="" class="ls-l" href="https://stelmus.co.za/village-museum/grosvenor-house/" target="_self" data-ls="offsetxin:-150;durationin:2000;easingin:easeOutExpo;rotateyin:-30;transformoriginin:199.2% -244.4% -600px;offsetxout:100;durationout:800;easingout:easeInExpo;rotateyout:30;transformoriginout:199.2% -244.4% -600px;hover:true;hoverdurationin:300;hoveropacity:1;hoverbgcolor:#ffa319;parallax:true;parallaxlevel:30;"><p style="font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;padding-right:30px;padding-left:30px;font-family:Montserrat;font-size:19px;line-height:45px;color:#ffffff;border-radius:10px;top:402px;left:66px;background-color:#2764b3;" class="ls-text-layer">SEE DETAILS</p></a><a style="" class="ls-l" href="http://www.miniusa.com/content/dam/mini/models/jcw/JCW%20HARDTOP/Gallery/JCW_Gallery1.jpg/jcr:content/renditions/cq5dam.web.1550.3100.jpeg" target="_self" data-ls="offsetxin:-150;durationin:2000;easingin:easeOutExpo;rotateyin:-30;transformoriginin:-185.1% 134.1% -1400px;offsetxout:100;durationout:800;easingout:easeInExpo;rotateyout:30;transformoriginout:-185.1% 134.1% -1400px;hover:true;hoveropacity:1;hoverscalex:0.95;hoverscaley:0.95;parallax:true;parallaxlevel:70;"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="375" height="250" src="https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/v4.jpg" class=" ls-imagelightbox ls-img-layer" alt="" srcset="https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/v4.jpg 375w, https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/v4-300x200.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 375px) 100vw, 375px" style="border-radius:50%;top:175px;left:770px;width:207px;height:197px;"></a><a style="" class="ls-l" href="http://www.miniusa.com/content/dam/mini/models/jcw/JCW%20HARDTOP/Gallery/JCWhardtop_Lunch_Tray_Large.jpg/jcr:content/renditions/cq5dam.web.1024.2048.jpeg" target="_self" data-ls="offsetxin:-150;durationin:2000;easingin:easeOutExpo;rotateyin:-30;transformoriginin:-149.2% 170.4% -1200px;offsetxout:100;durationout:800;easingout:easeInExpo;rotateyout:30;transformoriginout:-149.2% 170.4% -1200px;hover:true;hoveropacity:1;hoverscalex:0.95;hoverscaley:0.95;parallax:true;parallaxlevel:60;"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="250" height="167" src="https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/v11.jpg" class=" ls-imagelightbox ls-img-layer" alt="" style="border-radius:50%;top:374px;left:435px;width:199px;height:181px;"></a><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="148" height="410" src="https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/21_s.png" class="ls-l ls-img-layer" alt