					<div class="et_pb_blurb_container">
						<h4 class="et_pb_module_header"><span>Conference Facilities</span></h4>
						<div class="et_pb_blurb_description"><p style="text-align: left;">Conference facilities are available for groups to the maximum of 20 people.<br />Strict Covid-19 measures are in place.  Four secure parking spaces are included when you hire the conference facility.<br />For bookings or enquiries please contact Lamees Petersen on <strong>021 887 2937</strong></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-43979 alignleft" src="https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/stelmus00003-300x222.jpg" alt="" width="192" height="142" /> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-43978 size-medium alignleft" src="https://stelmus.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/stelmus00001-300x142.jpg" alt="" width="300" height="142" /></p></div>
